    {
      "id": "S001",
      "char_start": 0,
      "char_end": 31,
      "start_ms": 148,
      "end_ms": 5037,
      "duration_ms": 4889,
      "text": "咱们今天聊的这只童子鸡，它是来自安徽皖南高山区域的纯种土黄鸡。",
      "pause_after_ms": 0,
      "cut_after_ms": 5037,
      "safe_score": 82,
      "safe_grade": "A",
      "safe_reason": [
        "strong_sentence_end"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S002",
      "char_start": 31,
      "char_end": 66,
      "start_ms": 4815,
      "end_ms": 10074,
      "duration_ms": 5259,
      "text": "大家拿到手的时候，可以先别急着下锅，把袋子拆开，仔细看看这个鸡的状态。",
      "pause_after_ms": 0,
      "cut_after_ms": 10074,
      "safe_score": 82,
      "safe_grade": "A",
      "safe_reason": [
        "strong_sentence_end"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S003",
      "char_start": 66,
      "char_end": 105,
      "start_ms": 9852,
      "end_ms": 16074,
      "duration_ms": 6222,
      "text": "你会发现它的皮是比较薄的，皮下基本以精瘦肉为主，肉质呈现出一种相对紧实的感觉。",
      "pause_after_ms": 0,
      "cut_after_ms": 16074,
      "safe_score": 70,
      "safe_grade": "B",
      "safe_reason": [
        "strong_sentence_end",
        "next_sentence_context_dependent"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S004",
      "char_start": 105,
      "char_end": 127,
      "start_ms": 16000,
      "end_ms": 19333,
      "duration_ms": 3333,
      "text": "这种状态其实跟它在山上的生长过程是分不开的。",
      "pause_after_ms": 0,
      "cut_after_ms": 19333,
      "safe_score": 82,
      "safe_grade": "A",
      "safe_reason": [
        "strong_sentence_end"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S005",
      "char_start": 127,
      "char_end": 181,
      "start_ms": 19185,
      "end_ms": 27111,
      "duration_ms": 7926,
      "text": "它不是那种关在笼子里的圈养模式，而是属于跑山鸡、溜达鸡，在漫山遍野的高山环境里活动，平时的运动量是比较大的。",
      "pause_after_ms": 0,
      "cut_after_ms": 27111,
      "safe_score": 82,
      "safe_grade": "A",
      "safe_reason": [
        "strong_sentence_end"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S006",
      "char_start": 181,
      "char_end": 241,
      "start_ms": 26963,
      "end_ms": 36222,
      "duration_ms": 9259,
      "text": "正因为有这种放养空间，鸡在活动过程中会自己捕食一些小虫、小竹笋这些天然的东西，同时我们也会配合喂人工科学配比的安全食材。",
      "pause_after_ms": 0,
      "cut_after_ms": 36222,
      "safe_score": 70,
      "safe_grade": "B",
      "safe_reason": [
        "strong_sentence_end",
        "next_sentence_context_dependent"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S007",
      "char_start": 241,
      "char_end": 270,
      "start_ms": 36148,
      "end_ms": 40593,
      "duration_ms": 4445,
      "text": "这样做的逻辑很简单，就是让鸡吃得干净，咱们人才能吃得放心。",
      "pause_after_ms": 0,
      "cut_after_ms": 40593,
      "safe_score": 82,
      "safe_grade": "A",
      "safe_reason": [
        "strong_sentence_end"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S008",
      "char_start": 270,
      "char_end": 341,
      "start_ms": 40444,
      "end_ms": 51407,
      "duration_ms": 10963,
      "text": "现在下单的都是活鸡新鲜宰杀，而且我知道很多朋友特别在意完整性，我们这边是保留鸡真、鸡肝、鸡心的，整只去头、去鸡屁股后切块发货，也就是原切状态。",
      "pause_after_ms": 0,
      "cut_after_ms": 51407,
      "safe_score": 82,
      "safe_grade": "A",
      "safe_reason": [
        "strong_sentence_end"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S009",
      "char_start": 341,
      "char_end": 371,
      "start_ms": 51333,
      "end_ms": 56074,
      "duration_ms": 4741,
      "text": "虽然切了块，但品质和整只的一样，像清蒸这种做法也完全没问题。",
      "pause_after_ms": 0,
      "cut_after_ms": 56074,
      "safe_score": 82,
      "safe_grade": "A",
      "safe_reason": [
        "strong_sentence_end"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S010",
      "char_start": 371,
      "char_end": 397,
      "start_ms": 55926,
      "end_ms": 60148,
      "duration_ms": 4222,
      "text": "单只毛重两斤以上，净重大概在一点二斤到一点八斤左右。",
      "pause_after_ms": 0,
      "cut_after_ms": 60148,
      "safe_score": 82,
      "safe_grade": "A",
      "safe_reason": [
        "strong_sentence_end"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S011",
      "char_start": 397,
      "char_end": 425,
      "start_ms": 60000,
      "end_ms": 64296,
      "duration_ms": 4296,
      "text": "关于物流这块，我得多啰嗦几句，因为很多外地朋友关心时效。",
      "pause_after_ms": 0,
      "cut_after_ms": 64296,
      "safe_score": 82,
      "safe_grade": "A",
      "safe_reason": [
        "strong_sentence_end"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S012",
      "char_start": 425,
      "char_end": 459,
      "start_ms": 64148,
      "end_ms": 69556,
      "duration_ms": 5408,
      "text": "江浙沪皖的朋友，正常发货后基本隔天就能到，其他地区大概需要两到三天。",
      "pause_after_ms": 0,
      "cut_after_ms": 69556,
      "safe_score": 82,
      "safe_grade": "A",
      "safe_reason": [
        "strong_sentence_end"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S013",
      "char_start": 459,
      "char_end": 474,
      "start_ms": 69333,
      "end_ms": 72000,
      "duration_ms": 2667,
      "text": "大家收到后按实际状态检查即可。",
      "pause_after_ms": 0,
      "cut_after_ms": 72000,
      "safe_score": 82,
      "safe_grade": "A",
      "safe_reason": [
        "strong_sentence_end"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S014",
      "char_start": 474,
      "char_end": 516,
      "start_ms": 71778,
      "end_ms": 78370,
      "duration_ms": 6592,
      "text": "如果拿到手不知道怎么处理，包装袋后面有教程入口，或者联系客服获取详细做法指导都可以。",
      "pause_after_ms": 0,
      "cut_after_ms": 78370,
      "safe_score": 70,
      "safe_grade": "B",
      "safe_reason": [
        "strong_sentence_end",
        "next_sentence_context_dependent"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S015",
      "char_start": 516,
      "char_end": 564,
      "start_ms": 78222,
      "end_ms": 85852,
      "duration_ms": 7630,
      "text": "那么对于这种皮薄肉紧、内脏齐全且已切块方便处理的原切童子鸡，您觉得这个规格适合家里一顿饭的量吗？",
      "pause_after_ms": 0,
      "cut_after_ms": 85852,
      "safe_score": 82,
